    <article class="space-y-5 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-[17px]">
      <p>Premium domains trade like category real estate. Here is the 5-factor model behind the <strong class="text-white">eDesigr.monster — $95,000</strong> list price:</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">1. Semantic ownership</h2>
