      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">3. TLD energy fit</h2>
      <p>.monster is bold and creative-native — a fit premium for art/AI brands that a flat .com cannot replicate. Comparable creative-TLD sales cluster $40k–$210k.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">4. Comparables</h2>
      <p>Public 2024–2026 creative/AI domain reports: short AI-studio names $88k–$210k. At $95k, eDesigr.monster sits at the accessible end of investment-grade with category upside.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-white pt-4">5. Category timing</h2>
      <p>Generative art + AI copy tooling is still expanding. Owning the semantic home <em>before</em> saturation is where appreciation comes from.</p>
